# More info: https://docs.docker.com/engine/reference/builder/#dockerignore-file
# Ignore everything by default and re-include only needed files
**

# Re-include Go source files (but not *_test.go)
!**/*.go
**/*_test.go

# Re-include Go module files
!go.mod
!go.sum

# Re-include the licence and attribution files the image has to carry.
# Without these the `**` above keeps them out of the build context and the
# COPY in the Dockerfile fails, so a missing file breaks the build rather
# than shipping an image with no attribution.
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
